  "details": "1. \"Build & Test your world\" Clients: 2 or more\n\n2. use the drone on both clients\n\n3. one of the clients drone will disappear and start spamming the console\n\n4. get banned for trying to use a drone in a local test (thats a big no no in vrchats eyes.)\n\nplease fix & also unban me for trying to use a drone in a playtest\n\ni attempted to record a video of it by using a alt that i use for world development but it seemed to just not want to do it and just rather just be glitchy in all other ways instead ig but from the video at the very least you can see that the drone is clearly not acting correctly.\n\nVideo: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tcH7ygIi_0U",
